add('9:c',['A3.4.4'],'A distributed database replicates personal records across several sites. Discuss the security benefits and risks of replication,and how a deletion request should be handled consistently. No knowledge of a particular privacy law is required.','Replication supports fault tolerance: a site failure need not make all records unavailable. But every copy needs appropriate access controls; a weakly protected site can expose data,and incomplete deletion can leave personal records elsewhere. Coordinated updates/deletions and checks across replicas are needed to preserve consistency. Replication is useful for availability only when security and update consistency are managed across all sites.',[(1,'Replication availability/fault-tolerance benefit.'),(1,'Explains a site-failure benefit.'),(1,'Multiple copies increase security-management exposure.'),(1,'Explains stale undeleted personal-data risk.'),(1,'Coordinated deletion/update consistency requirement.'),(1,'Balanced contextual conclusion.')],[19,20],status='B',adapt='Retains decentralization/privacy reasoning only through explicit distributed-database replication,data security and consistency; removes web-politics/legal recall.')
add('9:d',['A2.1.2'],'Explain three ways cloud infrastructure could help a small subscription-software company serve overseas customers.','Remote hosted resources can deliver the service over networks without shipping physical installations. Capacity can grow with international demand without purchasing all peak hardware upfront. Provider-managed infrastructure can reduce the small firm’s physical maintenance workload,allowing it to concentrate on maintaining the service,while it remains responsible for its own data/access configuration.',[(1,'Network-accessible remotely hosted service.'),(1,'Explains overseas delivery without physical distribution.'),(1,'Elastic/rented capacity.'),(1,'Explains expansion/capital benefit.'),(1,'Provider-managed physical infrastructure.'),(1,'Explains small-team maintenance benefit without removing all responsibility.')],[21],status='B',adapt='Retains cloud-enabled international service reasoning,not SEO/API/e-commerce details.')
